    <footer class="p-4 text-center text-sm text-balance [&_a]:text-purple-500 [&_a]:underline">
      Challenge by <a
        href="https://www.frontendmentor.io?ref=challenge"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">Frontend Mentor</a
      >. Coded by <a
        href="https://www.frontendmentor.io/profile/mupinnn"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">@mupinnn</a
